WEBVTT

00:01.341 --> 00:03.384
GIRL: Water.

00:03.510 --> 00:05.428
Earth.

00:05.553 --> 00:07.514
Fire.

00:07.639 --> 00:10.266
Air.

00:10.391 --> 00:14.103
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:14.229 --> 00:18.775
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:18.858 --> 00:21.778
Only the Avatar, master of
all four elements, could stop them.

00:21.861 --> 00:26.241
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

00:26.324 --> 00:30.078
A hundred years passed, and my brother
and I discovered the new Avatar,

00:30.161 --> 00:31.829
an airbender named Aang.

00:31.913 --> 00:34.374
And although his
airbending skills are great,

00:34.499 --> 00:36.709
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

00:36.793 --> 00:37.877
AANG: Oof!

00:37.961 --> 00:40.755
But I believe Aang can save the world.

00:47.136 --> 00:49.764
MAN: Previously on Avatar...

00:49.889 --> 00:52.308
Don't you know fans
just make flame stronger?

00:55.979 --> 00:58.189
I am Long Feng, head of the Dai Li.

00:58.314 --> 01:00.149
Why won't you let us talk to the king?

01:00.275 --> 01:03.653
The Earth King has no time to
get involved with political squabbles.

01:03.778 --> 01:05.822
So the king is just a figurehead?

01:05.947 --> 01:07.407
He's your puppet!

01:08.324 --> 01:10.994
It's time for you to look inward,

01:11.119 --> 01:14.080
and begin asking yourself
the big questions.

01:14.205 --> 01:15.582
Who are you?

01:16.207 --> 01:17.333
And what do you want?

01:18.042 --> 01:20.295
I can handle you by myself.

01:20.587 --> 01:23.256
( RUMBLING )

01:23.381 --> 01:25.049
I missed you, buddy.

01:36.686 --> 01:40.607
I missed you more than
you'll ever know, buddy.

01:40.732 --> 01:43.776
( LAUGHING )

01:43.901 --> 01:46.571
Look, we escaped from
the Dai Li, we got Appa back,

01:46.654 --> 01:50.158
I'm telling you, we should go to
the Earth King now and tell him our plan.

01:50.241 --> 01:51.618
We're on a roll.

01:51.743 --> 01:54.495
One good hour after weeks of
trouble isn't much of a roll.

01:54.621 --> 01:55.622
We can build on it.

01:55.705 --> 01:58.708
If we want to invade
the Fire Nation when the eclipse happens,

01:58.791 --> 02:00.376
we need the Earth King's support.

02:00.460 --> 02:02.545
What makes you think we'll get it?

02:02.670 --> 02:04.172
I don't know if you've noticed,

02:04.255 --> 02:07.216
but things don't usually go that
smoothly for our little gang.

02:07.300 --> 02:09.510
I know, but I've got
a good feeling about this.

02:09.594 --> 02:10.845
This time'll be different.

02:10.928 --> 02:12.930
Sokka, Long Feng is in control
of the city.

02:13.014 --> 02:16.267
His conspiracy with the Dai Li
is too powerful.

02:16.351 --> 02:19.937
I think we should just keep flying and
leave this horrible place behind us.

02:20.021 --> 02:23.650
I'm with sweetness.
I've seen enough of Ba Sing Se.

02:23.775 --> 02:26.361
And I can't even see!

02:26.444 --> 02:27.945
But now that we have Appa back,

02:28.029 --> 02:31.157
there's nothing stopping us from telling
the Earth King the truth.

02:31.240 --> 02:32.825
About the conspiracy and the war.

02:32.909 --> 02:34.535
See, Aang's with me.

02:34.661 --> 02:38.873
It's the whole reason we came here in
the first place, we have to try.

02:38.998 --> 02:42.669
Well, I guess if the Earth King
knew the truth,

02:42.794 --> 02:44.962
things could change.

02:45.088 --> 02:48.216
I don't trust the new positive Sokka.

02:48.341 --> 02:51.010
( SHOUTING ) Long Feng
brainwashed you, didn't he?

02:55.640 --> 02:58.226
That's probably the Dai Li
searching for us, so?

02:59.602 --> 03:00.812
Let's fly.

03:00.937 --> 03:05.108
( ROARING )

03:05.900 --> 03:07.777
Can we please buy a new saddle?

03:07.902 --> 03:09.779
Riding bareback is terrifying.

03:12.490 --> 03:13.783
There it is.

03:13.866 --> 03:15.368
That whole thing is the palace.

03:15.451 --> 03:17.745
The Earth King's chamber
should be in the center.

03:17.829 --> 03:18.913
We have to be careful.

03:18.996 --> 03:21.582
Long Feng's probably warned
the king that we're coming.

03:21.666 --> 03:23.251
SOKKA: why would you assume that?

03:23.334 --> 03:26.421
If you ask me, I think we're
just gonna sail right... ( SCREAMING )

03:26.504 --> 03:28.047
- APPA: ( RUMBLING )
- What was that?

03:28.131 --> 03:29.465
SOKKA: Surface-to-air rocks!

03:29.549 --> 03:30.633
More incoming!

03:30.758 --> 03:31.759
( SCREAMING )

03:43.438 --> 03:45.022
AANG: ( GRUNTING )

03:53.072 --> 03:57.952
( SOLDIERS GRUNTING AND SCREAMING )

03:59.620 --> 04:01.873
( GROWLING )

04:21.434 --> 04:24.604
( SOLDIERS SCREAMING )

04:24.687 --> 04:27.023
KATARA: Sorry!

04:27.648 --> 04:28.649
( SOLDIERS SCREAMING )

04:32.153 --> 04:35.782
( SCREAMING )

04:35.865 --> 04:38.951
KATARA: Sorry, we just
need to get through to see the Earth King.

04:42.955 --> 04:44.332
( SOLDIERS GRUNTING )

05:00.139 --> 05:01.474
( SCREAMING )

05:04.018 --> 05:05.478
( SCREAMING )

05:07.313 --> 05:09.357
( GRUNTING )

05:22.119 --> 05:23.329
( SCREAMING )

05:27.458 --> 05:31.504
( SOLDIERS SCREAMING )

05:31.587 --> 05:34.340
SOKKA: Seriously, we're actually
on your guys' side!

05:36.259 --> 05:37.260
Sorry.

05:44.058 --> 05:45.518
SOKKA: In there.

05:45.601 --> 05:46.602
APPA: ( RUMBLING )

05:52.191 --> 05:54.277
( GRUNTING )

05:54.360 --> 05:56.070
Toph, which way to the Earth King?

05:56.153 --> 05:57.613
How should I know?

05:57.697 --> 05:59.699
I'm still voting we leave Ba Sing Se.

06:00.992 --> 06:02.618
SOLDIERS: Whoa!

06:05.705 --> 06:06.998
( SOLDIER SCREAMING )

06:09.208 --> 06:10.459
Burglar!

06:10.543 --> 06:12.003
Sorry, wrong door.

06:18.593 --> 06:21.012
You did the right thing.

06:21.137 --> 06:23.139
Letting the Avatar's bison go free.

06:23.431 --> 06:25.641
I don't feel right.

06:30.104 --> 06:33.691
( GROANING )

06:33.774 --> 06:34.775
Zuko!

06:42.074 --> 06:43.868
SOKKA: Now that's an impressive door.

06:43.951 --> 06:45.411
It's gotta go somewhere.

06:46.579 --> 06:48.080
( SCREAMING ) Yah!

06:50.541 --> 06:53.294
( GRUNTING )

06:56.839 --> 06:58.549
A little warning, next time?

07:07.475 --> 07:09.310
We need to talk to you.

07:09.393 --> 07:11.938
They're here to overthrow you.

07:12.021 --> 07:13.606
No, we're on your side.

07:13.689 --> 07:14.732
We're here to help.

07:14.857 --> 07:16.192
You have to trust us.

07:16.275 --> 07:17.693
You invade my palace,

07:17.818 --> 07:19.195
lay waste to all my guards,

07:19.278 --> 07:20.655
break down my fancy door,

07:20.780 --> 07:23.658
and you expect me to trust you?

07:23.783 --> 07:25.326
He has a good point.

07:25.451 --> 07:27.161
KING: If you're on my side,

07:27.286 --> 07:29.747
then drop your weapons and stand down.

07:36.170 --> 07:39.423
See, we're friends, Your Earthiness.

07:39.507 --> 07:41.008
( LAUGHING NERVOUSLY )

07:43.552 --> 07:44.804
( GRUNTING )

07:52.979 --> 07:54.563
LONG FENG: Detain the assailants.

07:57.274 --> 07:59.110
But we dropped our weapons.

07:59.193 --> 08:00.653
We're your allies!

08:00.736 --> 08:05.074
Make sure the Avatar and his friends
never see daylight again.

08:05.157 --> 08:06.534
The Avatar?

08:06.617 --> 08:08.202
You're the Avatar?

08:08.285 --> 08:10.162
Uh, no, him.

08:10.246 --> 08:11.455
Over here.

08:11.539 --> 08:13.708
LONG FENG: What does it matter,
Your Highness?

08:13.791 --> 08:15.209
They're enemies of the state.

08:15.668 --> 08:18.254
Perhaps you're right.

08:18.337 --> 08:19.380
( RUMBLING )

08:19.463 --> 08:20.923
( SNIFFING )

08:21.007 --> 08:22.049
( LAUGHING )

08:22.133 --> 08:24.677
Though Bosco seems to like him.

08:24.760 --> 08:26.220
I'll hear what he has to say.

08:28.222 --> 08:31.350
AANG: Well, sir, there's a war
going on right now.

08:31.434 --> 08:33.644
For the past 100 years, in fact.

08:33.769 --> 08:35.938
The Dai Li's kept it secret from you.

08:36.063 --> 08:39.483
It's a conspiracy to control
the city and to control you.

08:39.567 --> 08:40.651
A secret war?

08:40.776 --> 08:42.403
That's crazy!

08:42.486 --> 08:43.487
Completely.

08:43.612 --> 08:45.990
Long Feng didn't want us to tell you,

08:46.073 --> 08:48.075
so he stole our sky bison to blackmail us.

08:48.159 --> 08:50.202
And blackmail is the least of his crimes.

08:50.327 --> 08:52.204
He brainwashed our friend!

08:52.329 --> 08:53.664
All lies.

08:53.789 --> 08:56.500
I've never even seen
a sky bison, Your Majesty.

08:56.625 --> 08:59.170
Frankly, I thought they were extinct.

08:59.253 --> 09:00.921
Your claim is difficult to believe.

09:01.047 --> 09:02.965
Even from an Avatar.

09:03.090 --> 09:05.926
( WHISPERING ) These hooligans are part of
an anarchist cell

09:06.052 --> 09:08.804
that my legions have been
tracking for weeks.

09:08.888 --> 09:12.767
If you listen to them, you're playing
right into your own destruction.

09:15.227 --> 09:17.104
I have to trust my advisor.

09:21.192 --> 09:24.320
Wait, I can prove he's lying!

09:24.403 --> 09:27.114
Long Feng said he's never seen
a sky bison.

09:27.198 --> 09:28.532
Ask him to lift his robe.

09:28.616 --> 09:29.742
What?

09:29.825 --> 09:31.744
I am not disrobing.

09:36.874 --> 09:40.544
AANG: Right there, Appa bit him!

09:40.628 --> 09:43.214
Never met a sky bison, huh?

09:43.297 --> 09:46.258
That happens to be a large birthmark.

09:46.342 --> 09:48.469
Thanks for showing everyone.

09:48.552 --> 09:51.806
Well, I suppose there's no way to prove
where those marks came from.

09:51.889 --> 09:53.140
Of course there is.

09:53.224 --> 09:56.060
( RUMBLING )

09:58.604 --> 10:01.107
Yep, that pretty much proves it.

10:01.816 --> 10:03.400
( CHEERING )

10:04.443 --> 10:07.279
But it doesn't prove
this crazy conspiracy theory.

10:07.363 --> 10:08.739
( GROANING )

10:08.864 --> 10:12.409
Though, I suppose this matter
is worth looking into.

10:12.493 --> 10:16.122
KIDS: Uh, O.K., We'll take it,
uh, yeah, all right.

10:22.086 --> 10:23.337
( MOANING )

10:25.131 --> 10:27.007
You're burning up.

10:27.091 --> 10:29.218
You have an intense fever.

10:29.426 --> 10:31.804
This will help cool you down.

10:31.929 --> 10:33.597
So thirsty.

10:36.684 --> 10:39.061
Here's some clean water to drink.

10:39.145 --> 10:41.856
Stay under the blankets
and sweat this out.

10:53.492 --> 10:56.704
( COUGHING )

11:02.293 --> 11:05.254
So this is what a train is like.

11:05.379 --> 11:08.799
I didn't realize it would be
this... Public.

11:09.300 --> 11:12.344
So you've never been outside
the upper ring before?

11:12.428 --> 11:14.597
I've never been outside the palace.

11:14.805 --> 11:16.557
Now that's the way to travel.

11:19.143 --> 11:22.021
So, may I ask where we're going?

11:22.104 --> 11:24.857
Underneath Lake Laogai, Your Kingliness.

11:24.940 --> 11:26.567
To the Dai Li secret headquarters.

11:26.650 --> 11:28.068
You're about to see where all

11:28.152 --> 11:30.446
the brainwashing
and conspiring took place.

11:41.624 --> 11:43.167
TOPH: It's gone!

11:43.250 --> 11:46.003
Oh, don't tell me...

11:46.086 --> 11:48.881
That's O.K., Still got
my positive attitude.

11:49.006 --> 11:52.301
The Dai Li must have known we were coming
and destroyed the evidence.

11:52.384 --> 11:55.846
Hmm, that seems awfully convenient.

11:55.930 --> 12:00.476
Hey, if anything, this proves
the conspiracy exists even more.

12:00.559 --> 12:03.604
Long Feng was right,
this was a waste of time.

12:03.687 --> 12:07.524
If you'll excuse me,
I'm going back to the palace.

12:07.983 --> 12:08.984
The wall!

12:09.068 --> 12:11.278
They'll never be able to cover
that up in time.

12:11.362 --> 12:12.613
Oh, yeah.

12:14.281 --> 12:16.492
If you come with us to the outer wall,

12:16.575 --> 12:19.912
we can prove to you
that the secret war is real.

12:20.037 --> 12:22.915
No Earth King
has ever been to the outer wall.

12:23.040 --> 12:27.002
I don't have any more time
for this nonsense.

12:27.086 --> 12:30.506
If you come with us, this time
you can ride on Appa.

12:30.965 --> 12:32.758
( RUMBLING )

12:33.133 --> 12:35.719
( SCREAMING )

12:36.136 --> 12:37.638
First time flying?

12:37.763 --> 12:40.474
It's both thrilling and terrifying.

12:40.599 --> 12:42.977
Yeah, I hate it, too.

12:43.060 --> 12:45.062
I have to be honest with you.

12:45.145 --> 12:48.774
Part of me really hopes that what you're
telling me about this war...

12:48.857 --> 12:50.192
Isn't true.

12:50.276 --> 12:51.610
I wish it wasn't.

12:55.406 --> 12:57.616
( GROANING )

13:03.872 --> 13:07.876
( FAINT CHANTING )

13:12.006 --> 13:13.841
GIRL: It's getting late.

13:13.924 --> 13:16.468
Are you planning to retire soon, My Lord?

13:17.344 --> 13:19.179
I'm not tired.

13:19.263 --> 13:20.973
GIRL: Relax, Fire Lord Zuko.

13:21.056 --> 13:22.683
Just let go.

13:22.766 --> 13:24.351
Give in to it.

13:24.435 --> 13:26.812
Shut your eyes for a while.

13:26.937 --> 13:29.440
UNCLE: No, Fire Lord Zuko!

13:29.565 --> 13:31.650
Do not listen to the blue dragon.

13:31.775 --> 13:34.445
You should get out of here right now.

13:34.528 --> 13:35.529
Go!

13:35.612 --> 13:38.615
Before it's too late!

13:38.741 --> 13:41.368
GIRL: Sleep now, Fire Lord Zuko.

13:54.048 --> 13:55.257
GIRL: Sleep.

13:55.382 --> 13:57.468
Just like mother!

13:59.386 --> 14:02.598
Zuko, help me!

14:02.723 --> 14:03.724
( SCREAMING )

14:09.521 --> 14:10.898
It's still there!

14:12.858 --> 14:14.151
What is that?

14:14.234 --> 14:15.277
It's a drill.

14:15.361 --> 14:17.821
A giant drill, made by the Fire Nation,

14:17.946 --> 14:20.115
to break through your walls.

14:24.411 --> 14:27.539
I can't believe I never knew.

14:28.957 --> 14:31.293
I can explain this, Your Majesty.

14:31.377 --> 14:32.961
This is nothing more than...

14:33.087 --> 14:34.880
A construction project.

14:34.963 --> 14:36.173
Really?

14:36.256 --> 14:38.550
Then perhaps you could explain why there's

14:38.634 --> 14:41.637
a Fire Nation insignia on
your construction project.

14:43.430 --> 14:45.557
Well, it's imported, of course.

14:45.641 --> 14:48.852
You know you can't trust
domestic machinery.

14:51.188 --> 14:54.900
Surely you don't believe these children
instead of your most loyal attendant?

15:01.949 --> 15:04.535
Dai Li, arrest Long Feng.

15:04.618 --> 15:07.913
I want him to stand trial for crimes
against the Earth Kingdom.

15:18.257 --> 15:20.008
You can't arrest me.

15:20.092 --> 15:22.344
You all need me more than you know!

15:22.428 --> 15:25.222
Looks like Long Feng is long gone!

15:25.305 --> 15:26.974
Ha...

15:27.057 --> 15:29.143
Oh, yeah, I've been waitin'
to use that one.

15:35.107 --> 15:37.025
KING: I want to thank you, young heroes,

15:37.109 --> 15:39.027
for opening my eyes.

15:39.111 --> 15:42.906
All this time, what I thought was a great
metropolis was merely a city of fools.

15:43.824 --> 15:46.702
And that makes me the king fool.

15:46.785 --> 15:48.036
( RUMBLING )

15:48.120 --> 15:50.956
We're at war with the Fire Nation.

15:51.039 --> 15:53.834
SOKKA: That's why we came
to Ba Sing Se, Your Highness.

15:53.917 --> 15:56.295
Because we think
you could help us end the war.

15:56.378 --> 15:58.380
AANG: We don't have much time.

15:58.464 --> 16:00.174
There's a comet coming this summer.

16:00.257 --> 16:03.594
Its energy will give the firebenders
unbelievable strength.

16:03.677 --> 16:05.304
They'll be unstoppable.

16:05.429 --> 16:06.763
But there is hope.

16:06.889 --> 16:09.766
Before the comet comes,
we have a window of opportunity.

16:09.892 --> 16:11.977
A solar eclipse is coming.

16:12.060 --> 16:14.396
The sun will be entirely
blocked out by the moon,

16:14.521 --> 16:16.773
and the firebenders will be helpless.

16:16.857 --> 16:18.400
What are you suggesting, Sokka?

16:18.484 --> 16:22.237
That's the day we need to invade
the Fire Nation.

16:22.321 --> 16:25.449
The day of black sun.

16:25.532 --> 16:26.867
I don't know.

16:26.950 --> 16:29.369
That would require
moving troops out of Ba Sing Se.

16:29.453 --> 16:31.455
We'd be completely vulnerable.

16:31.538 --> 16:33.749
You're already vulnerable.

16:33.832 --> 16:37.461
The Fire Nation won't stop
until Ba Sing Se falls.

16:37.544 --> 16:40.714
You can either sit back
and wait for that to happen,

16:40.797 --> 16:44.384
or take the offensive and give
yourself a fighting chance.

16:47.971 --> 16:49.431
Very well.

16:49.515 --> 16:50.807
You have my support.

16:50.891 --> 16:55.062
( CHEERING )

16:55.145 --> 16:56.813
MAN: Your Majesty.

16:58.482 --> 17:01.443
I apologize for the interruption.

17:01.527 --> 17:03.111
KING: This is General How.

17:03.195 --> 17:07.407
He's the leader of the Council of Five,
my highest-ranking generals.

17:08.283 --> 17:09.785
We searched Long Feng's office.

17:09.868 --> 17:14.248
I think we found something
that will interest everybody.

17:15.207 --> 17:19.253
There are secret files
on everyone in Ba Sing Se.

17:19.336 --> 17:20.587
Including you kids.

17:20.671 --> 17:22.256
Secret files?

17:22.339 --> 17:23.924
KING: Toph Beifong.

17:27.177 --> 17:28.554
It's a letter from your mom.

17:28.679 --> 17:30.764
Your mom's here in the city.

17:30.847 --> 17:32.975
And she wants to see you.

17:33.058 --> 17:35.727
Long Feng intercepted
our letters from home?

17:35.852 --> 17:36.937
That's just sad.

17:37.062 --> 17:38.480
KING: Aang.

17:38.564 --> 17:43.151
This scroll was attached to the horn of
your bison when the Dai Li captured it.

17:43.235 --> 17:46.446
It's from the Eastern Air Temple.

17:46.530 --> 17:51.577
Is there a letter for me
and Sokka, by any chance?

17:51.702 --> 17:52.703
I'm afraid not.

17:54.663 --> 17:55.706
Oh.

17:55.789 --> 17:59.126
But there is an intelligence
report that might interest you.

17:59.459 --> 18:01.712
A small fleet of water tribe ships?

18:01.795 --> 18:02.963
What?

18:03.046 --> 18:04.381
That could be Dad!

18:04.464 --> 18:06.383
Protecting the mouth of Chameleon Bay?

18:06.842 --> 18:09.428
Led by Hakoda, it is Dad!

18:12.097 --> 18:15.475
UNCLE: You should know
this is not a natural sickness.

18:15.559 --> 18:19.771
But that shouldn't stop you
from enjoying tea.

18:19.855 --> 18:21.356
What, what's happening?

18:21.440 --> 18:25.986
Your critical decision,
what you did beneath that lake,

18:26.069 --> 18:29.906
it was in such conflict
with your image of yourself

18:29.990 --> 18:35.162
that you are now at war
within your own mind and body.

18:35.245 --> 18:36.830
What's that mean?

18:36.913 --> 18:39.875
( COUGHING )

18:39.958 --> 18:43.629
You're going through
a metamorphosis, my nephew.

18:43.712 --> 18:46.590
It will not be a pleasant experience.

18:46.673 --> 18:48.925
But when you come out of it,

18:49.009 --> 18:52.679
you will be the beautiful prince
you were always meant to be.

18:54.931 --> 18:56.433
AANG: I can't believe it.

18:56.516 --> 18:59.019
There's a man living at
the Eastern Air Temple.

18:59.102 --> 19:00.354
He says he's a guru.

19:00.437 --> 19:03.231
What's a guru?
Some kind of poisonous blowfish?

19:03.357 --> 19:05.651
No, a spiritual expert.

19:05.734 --> 19:08.779
He wants to help me take the next step in
the Avatar journey.

19:08.862 --> 19:11.323
He says he can teach me
to control the Avatar state.

19:11.531 --> 19:14.493
And I can't believe
we know where our dad is now.

19:14.576 --> 19:15.744
I know what you mean.

19:15.827 --> 19:17.621
My mom's in the city,

19:17.704 --> 19:20.999
and from her letter, it sounds like she
finally understands me.

19:21.083 --> 19:23.377
This is all such big news.

19:23.460 --> 19:24.836
Where do we even start?

19:24.920 --> 19:26.963
I hate to say it, but...

19:27.047 --> 19:28.507
We have to split up.

19:28.590 --> 19:29.966
Split up?

19:30.050 --> 19:32.511
We just found Appa and got
the family back together.

19:32.594 --> 19:35.138
Now you want us to separate?

19:35.263 --> 19:37.516
You have to meet this guru, Aang.

19:37.599 --> 19:42.020
If we're gonna invade
the Fire Nation, you need to be ready.

19:42.104 --> 19:44.481
Well, if I'm going to
the Eastern Air Temple,

19:44.564 --> 19:47.442
Appa and I can drop you off at
Chameleon Bay to see your dad.

19:47.526 --> 19:49.611
Someone has to stay here with
the Earth King

19:49.695 --> 19:51.363
and help him plan for the invasion.

19:51.446 --> 19:52.531
I guess that's me.

19:52.614 --> 19:55.951
No, Sokka, I know how badly
you want to help Dad.

19:56.034 --> 19:59.621
You go to Chameleon Bay,
I'll stay here with the king.

19:59.705 --> 20:01.832
You are the...

20:01.915 --> 20:04.751
Nicest... Sister... Ever!

20:04.835 --> 20:06.670
( KISSING )

20:06.753 --> 20:08.547
Easy there, big brother.

20:08.630 --> 20:10.090
Though you're right, I am.

20:16.972 --> 20:20.225
AANG: Katara, I need to
tell you something.

20:20.809 --> 20:22.936
I've been wanting to say it
for a long time.

20:23.019 --> 20:24.104
What is it, Aang?

20:24.187 --> 20:26.398
Katara, I...

20:26.481 --> 20:27.899
All right!

20:27.983 --> 20:32.237
Who's ready to get going on
a little men-only, man trip?

20:32.320 --> 20:35.782
Aang and Sokka, I wish you a good journey.

20:35.866 --> 20:37.951
Ba Sing Se owes you its thanks.

20:38.034 --> 20:41.163
And we look forward to your safe return.

20:42.164 --> 20:45.417
GUARD: Your Majesty, there are three
female warriors here to see you.

20:45.500 --> 20:47.127
They're from the island of Kyoshi.

20:47.210 --> 20:48.420
That's Suki!

20:48.503 --> 20:50.922
( SCREAMING )

20:51.006 --> 20:52.424
You know these warriors?

20:52.507 --> 20:53.550
Oh, yeah.

20:53.633 --> 20:56.219
The Kyoshi Warriors
are a skilled group of fighters.

20:56.303 --> 20:57.304
Trustworthy, too.

20:57.387 --> 20:59.556
They're good friends of ours.

21:00.390 --> 21:04.019
Then we shall welcome them
as honored guests.

21:04.102 --> 21:05.979
KATARA: Wait, Aang.

21:08.732 --> 21:11.485
( KISSING )

21:11.568 --> 21:13.570
TOPH: I'm really gonna miss you guys.

21:13.653 --> 21:16.364
KATARA: Me, too.
AANG: Yeah.

21:18.408 --> 21:19.659
( SCREAMING )

21:19.785 --> 21:21.870
Great, that's enough.

21:21.995 --> 21:23.914
O.K., We love each other.

21:24.039 --> 21:25.040
Seriously.

21:25.373 --> 21:27.959
( RUMBLING )

21:47.103 --> 21:49.981
( SCREAMING )

21:50.065 --> 21:51.358
( GASPING )

22:01.910 --> 22:03.954
SOKKA: You see, Aang?

22:04.037 --> 22:05.997
A little positive thinking works wonders.

22:06.081 --> 22:09.042
We got the king on our side,
we got Long Feng arrested,

22:09.125 --> 22:11.628
and when we get back,
Suki's waiting for me.

22:11.711 --> 22:13.004
Yeah.

22:13.088 --> 22:14.798
Girls are waiting for us.

22:14.881 --> 22:17.050
Thanks, positive attitude.

22:17.133 --> 22:19.719
Everything is gonna work out perfectly.

22:19.803 --> 22:21.596
From now on and forever.

22:30.313 --> 22:31.982
MAN: Dinner.

22:32.107 --> 22:35.819
The Council of Five and the military
are loyal to the Earth King.

22:35.902 --> 22:41.408
But the Dai Li remains loyal
to you, Long Feng, sir.

22:49.749 --> 22:51.501
( SIGHING )

22:55.589 --> 22:58.174
Hello, Mom?

22:58.258 --> 23:00.844
Anyone home?

23:03.680 --> 23:05.265
( SCREAMING )

23:05.390 --> 23:07.058
Hey!

23:07.183 --> 23:09.644
Who do you think you're dealing with?

23:09.769 --> 23:15.483
One loudmouthed little brat
who strayed too far from home.

23:24.159 --> 23:25.994
KING: In our hour of need,

23:26.077 --> 23:29.205
it is with the highest honor that I
welcome our esteemed allies,

23:29.289 --> 23:31.041
the Kyoshi Warriors.

23:32.626 --> 23:36.129
We are the Earth King's humble servants.
